/* Scoped motion for the /preview/tool template. Net-new, additive. Every
   animation is disabled under prefers-reduced-motion. Global pv-* / animate-*
   keyframes are reused where they already exist; only new motion lives here. */

/* "pinging…" scan line sweeping the tool panel */
